      <p>
        Checkstyle applies the rules in a configuration to your Java source
        files and reports every place the code doesn't follow them —
        just like the example above. Learn more about
        <a href="config.html">configuration</a> and
        <a href="running.html">running Checkstyle</a>.
      </p>
